description:
Implement `useFocusTrap` — a hook that traps Tab/Shift+Tab focus within a container element when active. Essential for accessible modals and dialogs.

**Example:**
```tsx
const { ref } = useFocusTrap(isOpen);
return <div ref={ref}>{/* Tab stays inside here when isOpen */}</div>;
```

